\section{Frozen hypothesis and isolated change}
\textbf{Hypothesis.} \VAR{summary.hypothesis|latex}

Every arm retains the exact 3,611,849-parameter Fusion v2.5 history-shortcut
architecture. The only intervention is an extra Smooth L1 location term on
training targets at or above the fold-training 90th percentile:
\[
\mathcal L=\mathcal L_{\mathrm{Student}\text{-}t}
+0.20\mathcal L_{\mathrm{pinball}}
+\lambda B^{-1}\sum_i
\mathbf 1[y_i\ge q_{0.90}^{\mathrm{train}}]
\operatorname{SmoothL1}(\hat y_i-y_i;\beta=0.10).
\]
The threshold is \VAR{summary.training_tail_threshold_log10_cn2|num} in
log10 \cn{} units and is identical across paired arms. No selection target
enters the threshold.

