\section{Limitations and next action}
This is a single-fold, single-seed development screen from one site. It cannot
establish seasonal robustness, instrument transfer, operational readiness, or
a champion. The upper-decile definition is target-level risk, not a physical
regime label. Only an arm passing every frozen screen condition may proceed,
unchanged, to three-fold and three-seed robustness. Full success would still
require the immutable 2\% margins and paired block-bootstrap evidence.

